A personal media tool, not a business.

It turns the owner's own photo and video library into edited Instagram photos and short reels.
It has no customers, no public surface, and nothing for the portfolio router to allocate
profit-seeking effort to, so it carries this marker instead of a VENTURE.yaml.

If it is ever offered to other photographers it would need an API-key backend (the Claude-plan
backend is for the owner's own use only), a VENTURE.yaml, and the usual disclaimers.
